# Forge autorun

Forge-specific additions on top of `marketplace-autorun`:

1. Prefer `/api/forge` and sandbox prove for skill lifecycle verification.
2. Keep full-package profile validation (`agent-skill-marketplace-full-package-v1`)
   intact when publishing skills.
3. When linking packages, ensure `SkillPackage.skillId` is set — orphan uploads
   leave terminal Packages empty.
